                  </story-point>
                  <story-point caption='The marketing spend trend closely follows total sales performance. Periods with higher marketing investment correspond to higher sales volumes, suggesting marketing campaigns are effective.' captured-sheet='Sheet 2' id='2' />
                  <story-point caption='Sales are distributed across Regular, Premium, and Occasional customers. Premium customers contribute significantly to revenue, while regular customers generate the largest share of repeat purchases.' captured-sheet='Sheet 5' id='1' />
                  <story-point caption='Products with higher discounts tend to achieve higher total sales.' captured-sheet='Sheet 4' id='4' />
                </story-points>
              </flipboard>
            </zone>
          </zone>
